---
#3959, track Q8 and §14.1 `bynk.given.parameterised_fn_value`: a function with capability
parameters is not a value, because a value would leave its bindings unchosen; a lambda that
binds takes its place (positive `3959_capability_parameter_forwarding`).
---
commons lib.cache

consumes bynk.cloudflare { Kv }

fn evict(key: String) -> Effect[()] given Inner: Kv {
	Inner.delete(key)
}

fn evictAll(keys: List[String]) -> Effect[()] given Store: Kv {
	let _ <- Store.delete("index")
	keys.forEach(evict)
}
